      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那风味很接近琴蕾。\n我在离她最近的地方，因她陷入最深的酩酊──\n这杯无酒精鸡尾酒非常符合我呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a820b8df6c59bc8b60246b8b2dadabc6e51afda0a1cafd6cfda27849205b51e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
